      "tag": "Stop 1",
      "h2": "The classic five",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">The classic five <span class=\"hl p\">senses</span>:</p><ul><li>Sight 👁️</li><li>Hearing 👂</li><li>Smell 👃</li><li>Taste 👅</li><li>Touch ✋</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 2",
      "h2": "How each one works",
      "body_html": "<p>Each sense has a special organ:</p><ul><li>Eye → light → brain.</li><li>Ear → sound waves → brain.</li><li>Nose → smell molecules → brain.</li><li>Tongue → taste buds → brain.</li><li>Skin → pressure and heat → brain.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 3",
      "h2": "Beyond the five",
      "body_html": "<p>Scientists now say humans have more:</p><ul><li><b>Balance</b> — inner ear.</li><li><b>Body position</b> (proprioception).</li><li><b>Pain</b>.</li><li><b>Temperature</b>.</li></ul><p>Senses are how the brain knows the world. 🌍</p>"
    }
  ],
